6068	// of the factored diagonal block at (j0,j0), into smem Uinv (row-major [r*w+c]).
6069	//   U x = e_c  (per column c of the identity)  ->  back-substitution up the rows.
6070	//   Uinv[i,c] = (delta(i,c) - sum_{p>i} U[i,p] Uinv[p,c]) / U[i,i].
6071	// One thread per column c (columns independent); the row recurrence within a
6072	// column is sequential (i = c..0). Reads U from smem sU (already staged).
